# AI Career Copilot 🚀

AI-powered career assistant that analyzes resumes against job
descriptions, identifies skill gaps, recommends targeted
improvements, and generates interview preparation.

## Product Flow

Resume + Job Description
→ Analyze
→ Diagnose
→ Recommend
→ Prepare

## MVP Features

- Resume parsing
- Job description analysis
- Candidate-job matching
- Match score
- Skill-gap identification
- Prioritized recommendations
- Resume improvement suggestions
- Interview preparation

## Tech Stack

- Frontend: Next.js / React
- Backend: Python / FastAPI
- AI/NLP: LLMs + Embeddings
- Database: PostgreSQL
- Analytics: PostHog
- Version Control: Git / GitHub

## Project Status

🚧 MVP under development